      "side": 1,
      "message": "What is the reason for this change? We need to add TIPC_IOC_SEND_MSG support, but it will not work if you call tipc_ioctl as the struct contains pointers to iovecs. Do you want a mixed mode switch where the TIPC_IOC32_CONNECT case breaks but TIPC_IOC32_SEND_MSG returns? It might be simpler to keep the old structure.",
